<img src="g30002g42z37.jpg" alt="LOGO" style="width:0.726624in;height:0.694385in"/>
</p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #bfbfbf; BORDER-TOP:0.75pt solid #430098; BORDER-BOTTOM:0.75pt solid #bfbfbf;vertical-align:bottom;background-color:#ece5f4">&#160;</td>
<td style="padding-bottom:2pt ;BORDER-TOP:0.75pt solid #430098; BORDER-RIGHT:0.75pt solid #430098; BORDER-BOTTOM:0.75pt solid #bfbfbf; padding-right:2pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ece5f4"><span style="color:#430098"><span style="font-weight:bold">FOR</span> each of the Board&#8217;s nominees for election to the Board to serve until the annual meeting of stockholders in 2027 and until their successors are duly elected and qualified (Item 1);</span></td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="BORDER-LEFT:2.00pt solid #7f7f7f; padding-left:8pt;height:3.75pt">&#160;</td>
<td colspan="2" style="BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #bfbfbf; BORDER-RIGHT:0.75pt solid #430098;height:3.75pt;background-color:#ece5f4">&#160;</td></tr>
