<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:9pt;background-color:#e5e5e5">
<td style="padding-bottom:4pt ;BORDER-LEFT:2.00pt solid #7f7f7f; padding-left:8pt;vertical-align:top"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.44em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;font-weight:bold">Item&#8201;1 &#8211; Election of Directors:</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;William Wyatt,</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;Libby B. Bush,</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;Lee Haspel,</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;Cris Keirn,</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;Daniela Kelley and</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;Julia W. Sze. </p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #ffffff;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="padding-bottom:4pt ;vertical-align:top"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;&#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">FOR</span>&#8221; one or more&#160;nominees;</p> <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;&#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">AGAINST</span>&#8221; one or more nominees; or</p> <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;&#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">ABSTAIN</span>&#8221; from one or more nominees</p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #ffffff;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="padding-bottom:4pt ;vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;&#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">FOR</span>&#8221; all nominees</p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #ffffff;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="padding-bottom:4pt ;vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span>&#8195;Majority of the votes cast: the individuals who receive more &#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">FOR</span>&#8221; votes than &#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">AGAINST</span>&#8221; votes will be elected</p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #ffffff;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="padding-bottom:4pt ;vertical-align:top"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span><span style="font-weight:bold">&#8195;Abstention</span>: No effect</p> <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="FONT-FAMILY:WINGDINGS">&#216;</span></span><span style="font-weight:bold">&#8195;Broker <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-vote</span></span>: No effect</p></td></tr>
