<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.44em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="color:#430098"><span style="font-weight:bold">Annual Cash Bonus Program</span></span></p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #bfbfbf;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL">Earned based only on shared corporate financial metrics and strategic objectives</p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="font-size:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">


