<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:left">Specific target levels are not disclosed because such disclosure would reveal confidential commercial and financial information regarding the size and performance of the Company&#8217;s D2C business that is not otherwise disclosed in its public filings and could result in competitive harm. Nevertheless, the Compensation Committee considers performance against this measure in determining incentive payouts and establishes D2C revenue targets it believes are rigorous and aligned with the Company&#8217;s operating plan and strategic objective. </p></td></tr></table>
 <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</p>
