</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="text-decoration:underline">2025 AEBITDA PSUs</span> </p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL">To align with our EBITDA financial goals, 50% of the PSUs are awarded in connection with achieving Adjusted EBITDA (&#8220;<span style="text-decoration:underline">AEBITDA</span>&#8221;) goals set for fiscal year 2025, measured from January&#160;1, 2025 through December&#160;31, 2025 and as reported in our Form <span style="white-space:nowrap">10-K.</span> No 2025 AEBITDA PSUs are earned if performance does not exceed a threshold performance level and payout is capped at 150% of target PSUs. The table below outlines the respective performance and payout levels, with payouts between performance levels interpolated on a straight-line basis. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:9pt;width:100%;border-spacing:0;margin:0 auto">


<tr>

