<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:left">The market value is based on the closing market price of our Common Stock on December&#160;31, 2025 ($14.03 per share). The actual payout values will depend, among other things, our actual performance through the end of the applicable performance periods and our future stock price. </p></td></tr></table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL" id="toc30002_42"><span style="color:#430098"><span style="font-weight:bold">2025 Option Exercises and Stock Vested Table </span></span></p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL">The following table sets forth information concerning each exercise of stock options and the vesting of restricted stock by our Named Executive Officers during 2025. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
