<td style="BORDER-LEFT:2.00pt solid #7f7f7f; padding-left:8pt;vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;font-weight:bold"><span style="font-style:italic">Qualifying Termination other than within CIC Protection Period</span></p></td>
