<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:left">The Base Salary Continuation amounts for the NEOs assume base salary in effect on December&#160;31, 2025, payable over the severance period. Messrs. Keirn and Weinswig&#8217;s severance period for a qualifying termination occurring other than within the CIC Protection Period is 12 months under their respective employment agreements. Ms.&#160;Wynne&#8217;s severance period for a qualifying termination within the CIC </p></td></tr></table>
