<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(1)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: ARIAL; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">The dollar amounts reported in columns (b), (d) and (f)&#160;represent the amount of total compensation reported for the Principal Executive Officer, and average total compensation for Other <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Non-PEO</div> Named Executive Officers for each corresponding covered fiscal year in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the Summary Compensation Table for each applicable fiscal year as listed below. Please refer to &#8220;<div style="font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Executive Compensation-2025 Summary Compensation Table</div></div>.&#8221; </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
