<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: ARIAL; font-size: 8pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">In column (d), PEO (Former): <ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:PeoName" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_JuergenStarkMemberecdIndividualAxis" id="ixv-14516">Juergen Stark</ix:nonNumeric>, our former CEO from September 2012 through June&#160;30, 2023. </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
