<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: ARIAL; font-size: 8pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">In column (f), <ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:NamedExecutiveOfficersFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-14517">Other NEOs for fiscal 2025: John Hanson, our CFO through February 3, 2025, Mark Weinswig, our CFO beginning February 3, 2025 and Megan Wynne, our General Counsel and NEO beginning in fiscal 2025; 2020-2024: John Hanson, our CFO from September 2013 through February 3, 2025.</ix:nonNumeric> </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_162999863" id="ixv-11672"><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_162999864" id="ixv-11673">
