<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:left">Amounts in this column do not reflect actual compensation received by our <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-employee</span> directors. The &#8220;Stock Awards&#8221; column reports the aggregate grant date fair value of restricted stock granted to our <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-employee</span> directors during 2024 in accordance with FASB ASC Topic 718 and assume no forfeiture rate. These restricted stock awards are granted under the 2023 Stock Plan, and the method for determining the number of shares subject to the grant is described below. </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
