<td style="padding-bottom:2pt ;BORDER-LEFT:2.00pt solid #7f7f7f; padding-left:8pt;vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:-0.56em; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL">Annual Cash Retainer Fee (other than the Chair of the Board)</p></td>
<td style=" BORDER-LEFT:0.75pt solid #ffffff;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
